  The draft says 'Senthamangalam' is the place of the ceremony, but the caption's location and the slide 'சேந்தமங்கலம், திருவாரூர்' are fine; however the reel_script lists 'வாழ்க்கை' and 'மணக்கால்' as areas of students, which matches the article, so no issue there.
  The reel_script and slides state the ceremony was 'ஏற்பாடு' by the academy and that students 'பங்கேற்றனர்' — the article says the students passed grading exams, not that they participated in the ceremony; the draft conflates the two.
